{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "柴田柚菜です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mob7ygnpQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "有明アリーナでのライブ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "4日間ありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『乃木坂46 Coupling Collection 2022-2025』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 5th ALBUM MEMORIAL LIVE『My respect』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさん楽しんでいただけましたでしょうか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "カップリングコレクションの方では、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「命の冒涜」を久しぶりに披露できたり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「Never say never」で久保さんのポジションに入らせていただいたり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「交感神経優位」は以前のアンダーライブのアレンジをやらせていただいたりと、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさんのカップリング曲をライブで披露できました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「パッションフルーツの食べ方」や「価値あるもの」なども好きなので聴けて嬉しかったです^ ^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46の楽曲はいろんなジャンルの曲があるところが良いですよね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもとは違ったセットリストで楽しかったです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私が出ていない曲のお話も、みなさんの感想もたくさん聞きたいです( ¨̮ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobQx6cNd.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回、心に残った曲は「My respect」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "曲自体も素敵でとても好きなのですが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "振り付けも素敵で、踊っているとき今乃木坂46にいる幸せを感じます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつかもっともっと大人になったときに聴いても刺さりそう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "泣けちゃうね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また、オリジナルメンバーでその曲を披露できることの貴重さを改めて感じたライブでした。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全体曲では、自分が選抜メンバーとして参加している曲で先輩のポジションに入っている後輩。当時とは全く違う景色に見えます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "期別の曲でも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "4期生は6人のメンバーが卒業していて、自分のポジションじゃない曲もありました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最終日のFake Doctorも一度きりの全員での披露でした🥼🩺"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして3期生さんの4人の姿"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "目に焼き付けました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだまだずっといてほしい。大好き。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その曲に参加しているメンバー全員とパフォーマンスできることがどれほど尊いことなんだろうと感じました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "意外と短い時間なのかもしれません…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だからこそ、一回一回の機会を大切にパフォーマンスしていきたいなと思います( ¨̮ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobdfQVvA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "4日目の写真は出ていたので、違うバージョン！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最終日はりかも参加できてみんな揃って嬉しかったよ~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メモリアルライブの方では今回、期別ブロックがあって4期生は可愛いセリフを言って初心を思い出したり、サングラスをかけてパーティーしたりしました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "特に、MCでは初めて自分たちで考えていいよーという時間をいただいて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなでグループチャットで意見を出し合ったり、ミーグリの合間やお休みの日にグループ通話をしたりたくさん話し合った時間が印象に残っています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも台本や企画を考えてくださるスタッフさんへの感謝の気持ちを改めて実感しました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもありがとうございます☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして4期生だけでの活動は最近少なかったので、今回でより深まったものがあるように感じています😌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなだいすき"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobhluL6h.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リピート配信は"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・乃木坂46 Coupling Collection 2022-2025"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2/27(金)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "開場(配信開始) 19:00 ／ 開演 20:00"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・乃木坂46 5th ALBUM MEMORIAL LIVE『My respect』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2/28(土) 3/1(日)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "開場(配信開始) 18:00 ／ 開演 19:00"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ観てほしいです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "14th YEAR BIRTHDAY LIVE！！！！わーい！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5/19.20.21の3日間！東京ドームにて！開催させていただきます🎂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "真夏の全国ツアー2026の開催も決定しましたー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨年より1か所多く、福井県に行くのは乃木坂46としても私自身も初めてです✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、今年も明治神宮野球場でラストを迎えることができます！ありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年の神宮も4Daysです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてそして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "41stシングルアンダーライブを開催させていただきます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぴあアリーナMM"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "3/17.18.19の三日間です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最終日はりかの卒業セレモニーもあります☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして6期生のみんなが初めて参加してくれるアンダーライブです！🐣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こうして今年もたくさんライブを開催させていただくことができて、みなさんとお会いできる機会もたくさんあってとても幸せです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日までのライブが終わり、なんだかやっと今年が始まった感じがします。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すぐに次のアンダーライブのリハーサルが始まります！楽しみです！わくわく"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年もみなさん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いします！たくさん思い出つくろうね☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mob2tY3PL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もっとみんなと写真撮ろう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "読んでくれてありがとう！またね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "（2.24 柴田柚菜）"}], "source": "official"}